WEBVTT

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:11.458
Don't die!

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:16.042
Live! Please, live!

00:00:28.792 --> 00:00:30.917
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:36.000
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.417
<i>Tsukiakari no shita de...</i>

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:46.125
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:50.958
<i>...yakusoku wo kawashita</i>

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:55.792
<i>Gozen reiji hoeru you ni sasayaite</i>

00:00:55.792 --> 00:01:01.250
<i>Chinmoku to zattou no naka</i>

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:06.375
<i>Kuruisou de kowaresou na genjou kai</i>

00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:10.208
<i>Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite</i>

00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:14.292
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:01:14.292 --> 00:01:19.458
<i>Kamereon janakute</i>

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:24.625
<i>Kokoro kara kawarou</i>

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:28.292
<i>Kikoeru yo sono kotoba</i>

00:01:28.292 --> 00:01:34.833
<i>Subete no yoru ga akeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:38.542
<i>Hageshisa to yasashisa de</i>

00:01:38.542 --> 00:01:50.125
<i>Subete no yoru ga sakeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:01.625
Hiyu?

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:06.125
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:11.125
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:02:11.125 --> 00:02:12.125
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Tenth Night"

00:02:12.292 --> 00:02:14.125
"The Bodhisattva Eye"

00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:21.833
All these lively youth,
all brimming over with energy.

00:02:21.833 --> 00:02:23.875
Must be nice...

00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:28.250
Oh, I wanna draw my bow again!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.542
Look, it's not gonna happen
and that's the way it is!

00:02:30.542 --> 00:02:33.750
We're all out of here at the end of September!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.208
What would a guy who's never been to
any of his after school club meetings know?!

00:02:37.208 --> 00:02:40.125
You have no idea how painful it is
for me to just sit there watching them!

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:43.458
Leggo! Hey, missus,
your hubby's lookin' mighty nutty.

00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:45.125
Here, check it out, Sakurai!

00:02:45.125 --> 00:02:47.333
Completely new to the market:
mint-pineapple flavor!

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.208
Huh? Looks good...

00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:51.083
--Doesn't it, though?
--But what is it anyway?

00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:53.958
--It's gum.
--Gum? No thanks.

00:02:53.958 --> 00:02:55.625
Oh, come on, have a piece.

00:02:56.833 --> 00:02:58.833
--Look, I went out and bought the stuff already.
--Huh? But it's gum.

00:02:58.833 --> 00:03:00.500
Oh, hey, Aoi!

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.125
You done?

00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:05.458
Yeah, sorry to keep you all waiting.

00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:07.792
Shall we get moving then?

00:03:07.792 --> 00:03:11.958
Hey, Aoi, don't we withdraw kind of early here?

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.292
What? You mean from club activities?

00:03:14.292 --> 00:03:19.083
Right! Sheesh, I'm so out of shape now!

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:25.750
First, have a look at this.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:26.458
"Kisaragi Antiques"

00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:28.292
I have compiled all the
incidents that have occurred

00:03:28.292 --> 00:03:30.792
since the demons started appearing so frequently.

00:03:30.792 --> 00:03:33.167
Wow, this many?

00:03:33.167 --> 00:03:35.458
Seems like the number
suddenly increased all at once,

00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:38.333
spreading out from the area
near Sakuragaoka Hospital.

00:03:38.333 --> 00:03:40.375
Since the thing with Sagaya?

00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:47.958
And last month's incident with Sera Rikudou.

00:03:47.958 --> 00:03:52.292
But ever since that, the demons
have not once shown themselves.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:58.375
You don't think maybe they
gave up attacking Tokyo, do ya?

00:03:58.375 --> 00:04:02.125
Hey, that'd be great, wouldn't it, Aoi?

00:04:02.125 --> 00:04:05.250
Yeah, well, of course it would.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:08.458
Sheesh, there's no chance of that!

00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:11.792
Kozunu, Tendo Kozunu...

00:04:13.125 --> 00:04:18.125
Yes, there is no likelihood that
he would drop the matter just like this.

00:04:18.125 --> 00:04:21.917
It is surely a short matter of time
before he launches some new scheme.

00:04:21.917 --> 00:04:27.125
Or rather, he may have
already launched his scheme.

00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:45.125
Does this mean all we can do is wait
patiently for our enemy to appear again?

00:04:45.125 --> 00:04:46.125
When it comes down to it,

00:04:46.125 --> 00:04:49.500
I'm gonna go on one heck of a rampage to
make up for all the time I've been kept waiting.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.417
Hey, Aoi.

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:53.792
Aoi!

00:04:53.792 --> 00:04:56.625
Oh, sorry! Yeah?

00:04:56.625 --> 00:04:58.125
What's the matter?

00:04:58.125 --> 00:05:01.417
I've just been kind of busy lately.

00:05:01.417 --> 00:05:03.667
You mean with the transition
with the student council and stuff?

00:05:03.667 --> 00:05:05.500
Yeah...

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:10.833
Oh, you're such an overachiever.
You've really got me worried, you know!

00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:13.458
I appreciate the concern, Komaki.

00:05:13.458 --> 00:05:17.625
Okay, so how about we go grab
some ramen while we're here in the area?

00:05:17.625 --> 00:05:19.292
Oh! I'm for that!

00:05:19.292 --> 00:05:21.792
Sure, I was just getting hungry.

00:05:21.792 --> 00:05:23.833
C'mon, why don't you come too, Aoi?

00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:28.333
Eating is just what the doctor ordered
for when you're feeling down! Right?

00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:29.375
I guess you're right.

00:05:29.375 --> 00:05:30.792
Well, I think I'll be heading home.

00:05:30.792 --> 00:05:32.458
Huh?!

00:05:32.458 --> 00:05:34.625
See you all tomorrow.

00:05:40.917 --> 00:05:43.250
What's with him?

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.542
Shall I tell you?

00:05:46.792 --> 00:05:47.958
Ugh! Anko?!

00:05:47.958 --> 00:05:50.625
Whaddya mean "ugh"?!

00:05:53.917 --> 00:05:56.125
The reason Hiyu's in such a hurry is...

00:05:56.125 --> 00:05:57.625
...this!

00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:59.375
Ta-dah!

00:05:59.375 --> 00:06:01.667
Hey! Could this be...

00:06:01.667 --> 00:06:03.583
One of those "dates"?

00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:08.625
Well now! The beautiful but fragile type, huh?

00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:11.625
This woman...

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.250
I'll bet you're surprised.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:19.125
I'll bet you never thought Hiyu
would have a secret like this, did you?

00:06:19.125 --> 00:06:21.625
And for your information,
her name is Sayo Hirasaka.

00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:24.000
She is in Class 2-5 at Sakurazuka
High School in Shinagawa.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.625
She is 5'6" and weighs 93 pounds.

00:06:26.625 --> 00:06:28.250
Her measurements...

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:29.417
I will not say.

00:06:29.417 --> 00:06:30.458
What?

00:06:30.458 --> 00:06:32.458
No offense.

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:35.000
She enjoys watching TV drama series.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.458
What else? Her favorite word is...

00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:39.792
..."reincarnation".

00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:46.417
Reincarnation? That's, like, got something
to do with religion or whatever, right?

00:06:46.417 --> 00:06:50.917
Master Ryuzan told me about that.
The idea that souls are reborn again and again,

00:06:50.917 --> 00:06:55.792
and continue to wander this
world of confusion and pain.

00:06:55.792 --> 00:06:57.458
And?

00:06:57.458 --> 00:07:04.167
Well, actually, both her parents died
during that whole crow incident.

00:07:04.167 --> 00:07:07.750
She herself somehow managed to survive,

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:10.792
but I hear she's been in
the hospital until just recently.

00:07:10.792 --> 00:07:12.750
I see...

00:07:16.167 --> 00:07:20.000
What's wrong?
You've got this frown on your face.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.958
Oh, uh, nothing.

00:07:21.958 --> 00:07:27.000
Anyhow, she's got relatives nearby
in Izu, who are going to take her in.

00:07:30.417 --> 00:07:36.208
Oh, no! I can't be here eating ramen!
I was in the middle of catching a scoop!

00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:38.458
I'll let you take care of the tab!

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:40.667
Consider it payment for
the information I've provided.

00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:45.833
Damn, she's gonna be one heck of a teleporter.

00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:47.125
Reporter!

00:07:47.125 --> 00:07:49.500
Shut up! I know what I'm sayin'!

00:07:51.458 --> 00:07:53.542
You all right, missy?

00:07:53.542 --> 00:07:54.583
Hey!

00:07:54.583 --> 00:07:55.833
Aoi?

00:08:03.458 --> 00:08:06.417
Hisui, it is about time that you also learned

00:08:06.417 --> 00:08:09.542
of our family's other mission which we uphold!

00:08:09.542 --> 00:08:14.333
It is said that at times there appears one...

00:08:16.125 --> 00:08:19.958
...who has the power to read the Dragon Stream

00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:25.083
and thereby select the chosen from
all creation and lead them to salvation.

00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:26.292
That individual

00:08:26.292 --> 00:08:33.292
is often among those who hold power in
their era and become a source of conflict.

00:08:33.292 --> 00:08:37.125
That person is known as the Bodhisattva Eye!

00:08:38.458 --> 00:08:45.042
Listen, Hisui, when the one who
possesses that star of fate appears...

00:08:48.042 --> 00:08:50.250
Lady Aoi...

00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:59.625
Man, when you look at it up close,
it's pretty damn amazing.

00:08:59.625 --> 00:09:03.083
Um, I'll be all right from here.

00:09:03.083 --> 00:09:04.833
Right.

00:09:04.833 --> 00:09:08.542
Okay, well, you be careful, all right?

00:09:08.542 --> 00:09:11.417
Thank you for walking me back, Houraiji.

00:09:11.417 --> 00:09:12.667
Sure.

00:09:22.208 --> 00:09:23.875
Aoi!

00:09:25.792 --> 00:09:28.458
Don't try to shoulder everything on your own.

00:09:30.167 --> 00:09:33.542
If anything happens, then say so. Got it?

00:10:03.708 --> 00:10:05.792
Good evening.

00:10:06.958 --> 00:10:08.625
Tendo Kozunu?!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.583
Don't give me such a fierce look.

00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:15.167
It spoils that pretty face of yours.

00:10:15.167 --> 00:10:17.625
Why are you here?

00:10:17.625 --> 00:10:20.542
Well now, why indeed?

00:10:21.625 --> 00:10:25.792
You see, I've only come to
give my regards this time.

00:10:25.792 --> 00:10:27.500
Regards?

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.125
Right...

00:10:31.125 --> 00:10:35.708
You're afraid of your power, aren't you?

00:10:35.708 --> 00:10:40.792
You've felt something powerful
squirming inside you, right?

00:10:40.792 --> 00:10:43.792
But you're pretending
that you're not aware of it.

00:10:43.792 --> 00:10:45.375
Stop...

00:10:45.375 --> 00:10:50.000
Your power is bringing misfortune to people.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:55.625
With you around, people are being
hurt and losing their lives as well.

00:10:57.875 --> 00:10:59.458
No...

00:11:00.833 --> 00:11:03.292
That's...

00:11:03.292 --> 00:11:11.208
But I am the only one who can revive that power.

00:11:11.208 --> 00:11:16.375
I want to protect everyone.
That's really the only reason.

00:11:16.375 --> 00:11:21.458
All the better then, come to me and you'll...

00:11:21.458 --> 00:11:24.500
You'll be able to protect everything,

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:29.750
all of your friends, and this town too.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:34.417
Well, I guess hearing that all of a sudden
is enough to make your head spin, huh?

00:11:34.417 --> 00:11:37.083
But it's the truth.

00:11:38.458 --> 00:11:45.333
If you really do want to save Tokyo,
I'll come get you anytime.

00:11:45.333 --> 00:11:48.500
You can never escape fate.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:53.458
Remember that much at least, Aoi Misato.

00:12:04.625 --> 00:12:09.625
Yes... Okay, tomorrow night then.

00:12:40.125 --> 00:12:43.542
Take her to Sakuragaoka Central Hospital.

00:12:43.542 --> 00:12:46.292
I'll take full responsibility.

00:12:46.292 --> 00:12:48.917
Who is that geezer?

00:12:56.375 --> 00:12:57.833
Yo...

00:12:57.833 --> 00:12:59.750
Kyouichi...

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.167
Looks like you're in quite a hurry.

00:13:02.167 --> 00:13:04.208
Yeah, got some stuff I need to take care of.

00:13:04.208 --> 00:13:06.042
Yeah...

00:13:06.042 --> 00:13:07.917
That, right?

00:13:07.917 --> 00:13:09.125
Yeah...

00:13:11.875 --> 00:13:15.625
You know, don't you?

00:13:15.625 --> 00:13:18.875
I don't have time now. I have to go.

00:13:22.083 --> 00:13:23.667
Hey, Tatsuma!

00:13:30.958 --> 00:13:36.417
Sheesh, it's not like they'll never meet again.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:41.917
"The Mysterious Transfer Student
Tender Love Revealed"

00:13:41.917 --> 00:13:45.167
I've been running nothing but
scary stories on the front page lately.

00:13:45.167 --> 00:13:50.375
I guess I can't forget about
my female readers though, can I?

00:13:56.083 --> 00:13:58.417
This is...

00:13:58.417 --> 00:14:00.458
My fate...

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:04.167
You can never escape fate.

00:14:04.167 --> 00:14:07.792
Remember that, Aoi Misato.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:11.458
Fate?

00:14:11.458 --> 00:14:14.708
Is Hiyu the same?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.500
"Kisaragi Antiques"

00:14:24.792 --> 00:14:29.792
Oh well, I guess I say goodbye
to this town today too, huh?

00:14:29.792 --> 00:14:31.917
We can see each other again any time.

00:14:37.833 --> 00:14:40.958
Here, just what you requested.

00:14:40.958 --> 00:14:44.125
You remembered!

00:14:44.125 --> 00:14:45.958
I have some clock ones too.

00:14:47.208 --> 00:14:48.792
Hiyu...

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.792
So, where does it take the picture from?

00:14:55.792 --> 00:14:58.167
Oh, you need to stand farther back.

00:14:58.167 --> 00:14:59.417
Huh?

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.792
You're so funny, Hiyu.

00:15:04.792 --> 00:15:05.667
I am?

00:15:05.667 --> 00:15:08.458
"Bubble Shower"

00:15:08.458 --> 00:15:10.542
Say...

00:15:10.542 --> 00:15:13.625
Those flowers you took along when
you visited the grave yesterday...

00:15:13.625 --> 00:15:15.042
The sweet peas?

00:15:15.042 --> 00:15:19.625
Yeah, people don't usually
put those in front of graves.

00:15:19.625 --> 00:15:23.000
I did because my mom loved those.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:30.458
Oh, and my uncle's family that I'm going
to live with grows sweet peas on their farm.

00:15:30.458 --> 00:15:34.125
I went there just once when I was a kid.

00:15:34.125 --> 00:15:39.250
They told me that those flowers
are all in bloom in December.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.750
I'm looking forward to seeing it.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.708
Sure...

00:15:42.708 --> 00:15:44.417
I bet it'll be beautiful.

00:15:49.042 --> 00:15:51.625
Oh, Hiyu!

00:16:01.083 --> 00:16:03.125
On rokei jimbala aranjiya sowaka!

00:16:03.125 --> 00:16:08.000
On rokei jimbala aranjiya sowaka!
On rokei jimbala aranjiya sowaka!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:12.167
Naumaku sanmanda bazaradan
sendamakaroshiyada sohataya untarata...

00:16:12.167 --> 00:16:15.792
Hisui Kisaragi marishi kan man sowaka.

00:16:19.333 --> 00:16:22.833
Houraiji, why are you here?

00:16:22.833 --> 00:16:25.583
Well, you could say I kinda had a bad feeling.

00:16:25.583 --> 00:16:30.417
So, I follow you and catch you
pulling out that dangerous thing.

00:16:30.417 --> 00:16:35.000
I really hate it when
people keep secrets from me.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.792
You're the one who told me
to be prepared to do this.

00:16:37.792 --> 00:16:41.333
So, how about you fess up
and give it to us straight?

00:16:44.875 --> 00:16:46.708
Say something, damn it.

00:16:50.292 --> 00:16:52.458
It's about Aoi, isn't it?

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:57.708
Kisaragi, what is happening to Aoi now?

00:16:57.708 --> 00:16:59.833
What are you trying to do?

00:17:02.458 --> 00:17:05.083
The power which Lady Aoi possesses...

00:17:05.083 --> 00:17:08.625
What about it? What is this "power"?

00:17:11.458 --> 00:17:13.500
The Bodhisattva Eye!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.625
Bodhisattva Eye?

00:17:15.625 --> 00:17:17.667
What's that supposed to be?

00:17:17.667 --> 00:17:22.125
An accursed power, which will allegedly
lead the world to its destruction.

00:17:22.125 --> 00:17:25.167
Huh? Destruction?

00:17:25.167 --> 00:17:29.292
So, how does that make Aoi a problem then?

00:17:29.292 --> 00:17:33.792
She's been protecting Tokyo along
with the rest of us, hasn't she?!

00:17:33.792 --> 00:17:37.167
The varied incidents caused by the demons
have all been part of a slaughter

00:17:37.167 --> 00:17:44.083
to awaken Aoi's, or rather,
the Bodhisattva Eye's power.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:50.958
In order to awaken that power, Kozunu
has transformed people into demons

00:17:50.958 --> 00:17:53.958
and has been leading Tokyo
further and further into chaos!

00:17:56.292 --> 00:18:04.625
Listen, Hisui, when the one who
possesses that star of fate appears...

00:18:05.708 --> 00:18:09.042
So, what are you gonna do about it?

00:18:09.042 --> 00:18:11.875
That power must not exist in this world.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:16.708
...kill that person, regardless of
what circumstances there may be!

00:18:16.708 --> 00:18:20.292
That individual must be
vanquished at the hands of a Kisaragi

00:18:20.292 --> 00:18:22.208
before the Dragon Stream is disrupted!

00:18:22.208 --> 00:18:25.167
Naturally, we cannot allow them
to get their hands on her either!

00:18:27.583 --> 00:18:31.292
Then you're saying you'll kill Aoi?!

00:18:35.333 --> 00:18:38.875
It was naïve of me to put any trust in you at all.

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.875
Doom 'n Gloom, get ready to die.

00:18:42.875 --> 00:18:46.500
Simpleton, what would you know?

00:19:16.958 --> 00:19:24.250
You certainly said you'd protect
Aoi back then, didn't ya?

00:19:25.208 --> 00:19:27.542
Were those words a lie?!

00:19:29.708 --> 00:19:36.292
And did you plan to slice open
your own belly and die so selfishly?

00:19:36.292 --> 00:19:39.167
I'm not puttin' up with that shit!

00:19:54.917 --> 00:20:00.292
My... It's my fault, isn't it?

00:20:00.292 --> 00:20:01.708
Lady Aoi...

00:20:01.708 --> 00:20:03.000
Aoi!

00:20:04.708 --> 00:20:09.625
All the incidents that have
happened so far... They're all my...

00:20:12.958 --> 00:20:14.500
The fireflies...

00:20:24.167 --> 00:20:25.167
Lady Aoi!

00:20:25.167 --> 00:20:26.292
Aoi!

00:20:28.625 --> 00:20:29.833
Aoi!

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.167
I want to protect people? I want to save them?

00:20:37.167 --> 00:20:39.667
More than my own life?

00:20:39.667 --> 00:20:42.542
What was I saying?

00:20:43.875 --> 00:20:47.292
I said I wanted to protect people, but...

00:20:54.708 --> 00:20:57.333
The one behind it all...

